# Launches the escape capsule: C, held from the launch tunnel so that the first frame in space reads it, leaves
# the Cobra behind (the rear view watches it go), and 80 frames later the capsule is back at Lave's station.
# It starts from escape-pod.cdr (Tools/PrepareCommanders.py): the reference's own save with an escape capsule.
file JAMESON.CDR escape-pod.cdr
wait 0.5; key space; wait 3.5      # any key: the credits, then the status screen
key Escape; wait 0.3               # the disc menu
key l; wait 0.3                    # Load Commander: it asks for a file name
key j; key a; key m; key e; key s; key o; key n; key Return; wait 0.5
digest loaded 383d687fabcf44c85755d161c37ed78d22833424dd4d861c54cf65fa84749d4a
picture loaded 361ad782e46b4fca68ba8e14bbac08966458c215f96b0ec2b628c924935fc8d5
